  {
    "id": "2064480977641230785",
    "author": "shloked",
    "authorName": "Shlok Khemani",
    "url": "https://x.com/shloked/status/2064480977641230785",
    "text": "Asked Fable to build a navigable version of Yosemite to scale\n\n> pulled satellite imagery + real NASA elevation data\n> classified individual forest pixels and created ~266k procedural trees\n> custom water shaders for all 6 famous waterfalls + accurate placement on cliff brinks \n> five times of day: dawn to night \n> tested itself: flew the camera around headlessly, screenshotted its own work, and fixed tree colors + waterfall placement from what it saw\n> added snow etc. unprompted\n\nPretty fucking impressive",
    "createdAtISO": "2026-06-09T22:53:15.000Z",
    "date": "2026-06-09",
    "metrics": {
      "likes": 1322,
      "reposts": 72,
      "replies": 25,
      "quotes": 17,
      "views": 822131,
      "bookmarks": 807
    },
